	<AutoArm_EnableMod>Enable mod</AutoArm_EnableMod>
	<AutoArm_EnableModDesc>Colonists automatically equip better weapons based on their apparel policy.</AutoArm_EnableModDesc>
	<AutoArm_ShowNotifications>Show notifications</AutoArm_ShowNotifications>
	<AutoArm_ShowNotificationsDesc>Shows notification messages when colonists equip or upgrade weapons.</AutoArm_ShowNotificationsDesc>
	<AutoArm_ShowForcedLabels>Show forced weapon labels</AutoArm_ShowForcedLabels>
	<AutoArm_ShowForcedLabelsDesc>Adds a "forced" label to weapon names that have been manually assigned to a colonist.</AutoArm_ShowForcedLabelsDesc>
	<AutoArm_DisableDuringRaids>Disable during raids</AutoArm_DisableDuringRaids>
	<AutoArm_DisableDuringRaidsDesc>Pauses auto equip during raids and other threats. Avoids conflicts with combat mods.</AutoArm_DisableDuringRaidsDesc>
	<AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorage>Only auto equip from storage</AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorage>
	<AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorageDesc>Colonists only auto equip weapons from stockpiles, shelves, and other storage. Ignores weapons lying on the ground.</AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorageDesc>
	<AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgrades>Upgrade forced weapons</AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgrades>
	<AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgradesDesc>Colonists can upgrade forced weapons to better quality versions of the same type (e.g., normal revolver to masterwork revolver).</AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgradesDesc>
	<AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonists>Arm temporary colonists</AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonists>
	<AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonistsDesc>Temporary colonists without equipment restrictions (refugees, borrowed pawns) can auto equip weapons.</AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonistsDesc>
	<AutoArm_ForceWeapon>Mark bonded as forced</AutoArm_ForceWeapon>
	<AutoArm_ForceWeaponDesc>Bonded persona weapons are automatically marked as forced, preventing automatic switching.</AutoArm_ForceWeaponDesc>

